  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Minas Gerais Development Partnership Program III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Asociacin para el Desarrollo de Minas Gerais III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es promover el fortalecimiento del sector de infraestructura de transporte y logstica, contribuyendo para avances fiscales, dinamizacin econmica de regiones de bajos recursos y ampliacin de la insercin competitiva de Minas Gerais.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Its objective is to promote the strengthening of the transportation infrastructure and logistic sector, contributing to a fiscal improvements, economic outreach of small economics resources regions and increasing of the competitiveness of Minas Gerais.</narrative>
  </description>
